      "description": "Returns the state of one Broker: its instances with version, inbound and outbound TPS, and whether each is active. Use it for a first look at a Broker named by rocketmq_get_cluster_overview. For readiness, store and recovery detail use rocketmq_get_broker_diagnostics.",
