      "description": "Returns per-queue statistics of one Topic, a page at a time: minimum and maximum offset, message count and last update time, plus totals over all queues. Use it to see how much data a Topic holds and whether it is still written to. For where the Topic is hosted use rocketmq_get_topic_route.",
