        "openWorldHint": true,
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "title": "RocketMQ Topic configuration"
      },
      "description": "Returns the configuration of one Topic on every Broker that hosts it: queue counts, permission, order and message type, and the fields on which the Brokers disagree. Use it to find inconsistent Topic configuration. For hosting and routing use rocketmq_get_topic_route.",
      "inputSchema": {
