        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": true,
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "title": "RocketMQ broker list"
      },
      "description": "Lists the Broker instances of one cluster: name, id, version, inbound and outbound TPS, and whether each is active. Use it to learn the Broker names that broker_name arguments accept. It does not count Topics or Consumer Groups, so it is lighter than rocketmq_get_cluster_overview; for one Broker in depth use rocketmq_get_broker_diagnostics.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
