        "title": "RocketMQ cluster health"
      },
      "description": "Checks a cluster at a glance: which Broker instances are registered, which do not answer, which Brokers lack a master or a replica, and whether the replicas keep up. Returns a severity and findings that name the Brokers to look at. Use it first when you do not know where a problem is, then run rocketmq_diagnose_broker_health for a Broker it names.",
